      "label": "Phone-call panel — a content module (icon + number + reassurance/hours), distinct from the header's/mobile bar's phone BUTTON (design brief lists these as separate items: “Phone-call button” in the button system vs. “Phone-call panel” as its own component). Meant to be pasted standalone — e.g. into 12-single-service.json's or 13-single-location.json's aside quote panel, or onto the contact page alongside its existing ad hoc phone/email/hours rows. Root node is a plain block, not a section, so it drops into an existing layout without forcing a new full-width row."
